WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.182
Every customer conversation shapes how people feel about your brand.

00:00:06.332 --> 00:00:08.650
Is your team ready for every one?

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:12.267
Hi, I'm Tia. Welcome to Trainera.

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:20.507
Working alongside your recruiters, candidates take a real call with an AI customer, so you hire with confidence.

00:00:20.607 --> 00:00:27.558
Once they're hired, I get them ready. I teach them all your products, in courses built from your own material.

00:00:27.658 --> 00:00:33.054
Then they practise on call simulations, so they never learn on real customers.

00:00:33.154 --> 00:00:39.682
Every call gets a quality score, and when they pass, they're certified and ready to take real calls.

00:00:39.782 --> 00:00:46.600
Customer on the line with a question? Just click or tap to talk to me, and I'll answer it from your own product documents.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:52.162
Managers see who's ready, who needs coaching, and exactly what to work on.

00:00:52.262 --> 00:00:56.071
Hire, train and coach, all in one place.

00:00:56.271 --> 00:00:59.690
Trainera. Ready for every conversation.
